OL,3,GSouth West                             
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FEastern      
OL,6,Fareas will hold onto patchy rain this  
OL,7,Fevening, though clear intervals are    
OL,8,Flikely further west. Fog patches are   
OL,9,Flikely to form under these clear       
OL,10,Fskies. Overnight, cloud will thicken   
OL,11,Fas wet and rather blustery weather     
OL,12,Farrives from the south.                
OL,14,CSaturday:FSaturday morning will be     
OL,15,Fcloudy, breezy and wet with outbreaks  
OL,16,Fof rain, some heavy. The rain should   
OL,17,Fease from the west during the          
OL,18,Fafternoon though, allowing skies to    
OL,19,Fbrighten later.                        
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
