OL,3,GSouth West                             
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunday  
OL,6,Fwill be much brighter, though a few    
OL,7,Fshowers are possible. Monday looks     
OL,8,Fcloudier, with some wet and windy      
OL,9,Fweather developing into Tuesday.       
OL,10,FTurning milder at the same time.       
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
